      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Two SequentialModel nodes with the same layers, because one model node wired into two trainers hands both the same weights. The only other difference between the rows is weight_decay on the Optimizer.\n\n兩個 SequentialModel 節點的圖層相同，因為一個模型節點接到兩個訓練器時，兩者拿到的是同一份權重。兩列之間另一個差別只有 Optimizer 的 weight_decay。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "loss",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 669
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
