        "noteContent": "The undecayed fit bends through the training points one by one; the decayed one follows the smooth curve underneath them.\n\n沒有衰減的擬合曲線一個一個穿過訓練點；有衰減的則沿著它們底下那條平滑的曲線走。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
